{"id":"war-of-independence","name":{"en":"The War of Independence","el":"Η Επανάσταση του 1821"},"summary":{"en":"Eleven years from the outbreak to a recognised kingdom, decided in the end by three foreign fleets in a bay the Greeks did not control.\n","el":"Έντεκα χρόνια από την έναρξη ως ένα αναγνωρισμένο βασίλειο, που κρίθηκαν τελικά από τρεις ξένους στόλους σε έναν κόλπο που οι Έλληνες δεν έλεγχαν.\n"},"events":[{"id":"revolution-outbreak","title":{"en":"Outbreak of the Greek Revolution","el":"Η έναρξη της Ελληνικής Επανάστασης"},"period":["1821-04-06","1821-04-07"],"significance":5},{"id":"fall-of-tripolitsa","title":{"en":"The Fall of Tripolitsa","el":"Η άλωση της Τριπολιτσάς"},"period":["1821-10-05","1821-10-06"],"significance":3},{"id":"chios-massacre","title":{"en":"The Massacre of Chios","el":"Η σφαγή της Χίου"},"period":["1822-04-11","1822-05-01"],"significance":3},{"id":"death-of-byron","title":{"en":"The Death of Byron at Messolonghi","el":"Ο θάνατος του Βύρωνα στο Μεσολόγγι"},"period":["1824-04-19","1824-04-20"],"significance":2},{"id":"exodus-of-messolonghi","title":{"en":"The Exodus of Messolonghi","el":"Η Έξοδος του Μεσολογγίου"},"period":["1826-04-22","1826-04-24"],"significance":3},{"id":"battle-of-navarino","title":{"en":"The Battle of Navarino","el":"Η ναυμαχία του Ναβαρίνου"},"period":["1827-10-20","1827-10-21"],"significance":5},{"id":"assassination-of-kapodistrias","title":{"en":"The Assassination of Kapodistrias","el":"Η δολοφονία του Καποδίστρια"},"period":["1831-10-09","1831-10-10"],"significance":4},{"id":"treaty-of-constantinople-1832","title":{"en":"The Treaty of Constantinople","el":"Η Συνθήκη της Κωνσταντινούπολης"},"period":["1832-07-21","1832-07-22"],"significance":5},{"id":"arrival-of-otto","title":{"en":"King Otto Lands at Nafplio","el":"Η άφιξη του Όθωνα στο Ναύπλιο"},"period":["1833-02-06","1833-02-07"],"significance":3}],"span":["1821-04-06","1833-02-06"]}